datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2018 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2018-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin D. Williams","x":"However, as I said, those electing to depart will benefit financially, which will be a cost for us in Q4 for the severance allowance that we will provide.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2018 Q3","e":"jkhy","d":"2018-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin D. Williams","x":"On the margin side, the other thing that I've talked about before is the timing of when we can get all the customers off one of the platforms because obviously when that happens, we'll be able to take a significant amount of cost out and that's not going to happen at the same time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2018 Q3","e":"jkhy","d":"2018-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin D. Williams","x":"So, there is going to be one quarter that's going to get a nice bump in margins because we're going to be able to take a significant amount of cost out for that one and then when we get all of the customers off of the other one, you're going to see a very nice bump in the margin.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2018 Q4","e":"jkhy","d":"2018-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Foss","x":"Although we felt we had forecasted conservatively, many fewer people took advantage of the program than we had expected and the Q4 severance charge ended being a little more than $3 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2018 Q4","e":"jkhy","d":"2018-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"On the restructuring, Glenn, it's amazing how many ProfitStars sales trail a new core win.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2019 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Foss","x":"And then remember, we are unable to take any cost out at this point, because we still have to keep the two platforms in place.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2019 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Foss","x":"So we can shut one of them down and start taking some cost out.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2019 Q4","e":"jkhy","d":"2019-08-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"As I said, we will see at least 30% of that cost savings by Q1 of FY21.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2020 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"With the cost reductions that we have talked about on previous calls that we will see the impact from in the first and third quarters of FY21, the impact those cost reduction will have on our quarterly and fiscal margins will remove those headwinds and allow us to return to a position of…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2020 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2020-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"David Koning","x":"…numbers questions, I guess just to make sure, I think you said before there is about 16 million cost savings once you kind of move off the old platform and I think you said a third and fiscal Q1 of 2021, so if we think that 16 million, it is kind of four million per quarter, a third of that…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2020 Q4","e":"jkhy","d":"2020-08-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"…on this line of revenue in the quarter were decreases within the product delivery and services license, hardware implementation services and pass-through costs, primarily related to billing for our implementation teams' travel decreased a total of $7.4 million compared to the prior year quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2020 Q4","e":"jkhy","d":"2020-08-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"So we've indicated in the past that there's a minimum of $16 million in cost savings that will come in -- some of that will come in Q2.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q1","e":"jkhy","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cinema","r":"management","s":"David B. Foss","x":"I think the best example of this in something you can see is for people who go to our client conferences, and this has been true forever at Jack Henry, you go to a Jack Henry client conference, you go into the exhibit hall and you will see hundreds of exhibitors in there.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q1","e":"jkhy","d":"2020-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin D. Williams","x":"…to product delivery and services revenue due to decreased license, hardware and implementation, pass-through and other revenue, but particularly the deconversion fee revenue quarter-over-quarter. Our processing line of revenue increased 7% in the first quarter of fiscal 2021 compared to the…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q1","e":"jkhy","d":"2020-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin D. Williams","x":"And then the other part of it is just pass-through costs from our travelers not being out for go out for billable travel to pass through.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2021-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"…is due to decreased license, hardware and imitation revenue for primarily on premise customers; pass-through revenue, which is related to our billable travel, primarily related to travel limitations related to COVID; and our Jack Henry Annual Conference, or our JAC, which was held virtually,…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"So, it's probably going to be a little less than that, that we see the impact in Q4 because remember, that number that we gave was for the full year annual cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q2","e":"jkhy","d":"2021-02-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"So we will start to see that cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q3","e":"jkhy","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"…convert merge implementation, which is also down to the significant decrease in M&A activity, pass-through revenues that is related to billable travel, primarily related to travel limitations related to COVID. And then obviously deconversion fee revenue for the quarter compared to the prior…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q3","e":"jkhy","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"So, Pete, what we've always said is we're going to get at least a minimum of $16 million cost savings out of that, and we're still stick to that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q3","e":"jkhy","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin Williams","x":"So we've had some significant headwinds this fiscal year on our convert merge revenue, we have done the risks or layoffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"JKHY 2021 Q4","e":"jkhy","d":"2021-08-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kartik Meh